WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:10.241
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:15.608
What do they see?

3
00:00:15.609 --> 00:00:24.523
They see chalk.

4
00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:31.063
The blobs are ready to draw.

5
00:00:31.064 --> 00:01:03.193
They draw flowers on the path.

6
00:01:03.194 --> 00:01:29.775
They draw people on the path.

7
00:01:29.776 --> 00:02:03.107
They draw animals on the path.

8
00:02:03.108 --> 00:02:21.735
They draw airplanes on the path.

9
00:02:21.736 --> 00:02:36.803
They draw clouds on the path.

10
00:02:36.804 --> 00:02:55.072
They draw umbrellas on the path.

11
00:02:55.073 --> 00:03:11.609
Blobs, what are you drawing now?

12
00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:18.472
Wow! It's a fireworks show!

13
00:03:18.473 --> 00:03:21.583
Silly Blobs.

14
00:03:21.584 --> 00:03:25.977
Good-bye!

